  "notes": "Finn wants the loading bay kept clear for the visitors. The coffee machine in the harbour room is working again. Remind me later that Nils prefers the print room for reviews. Remind me later that Teo prefers the garden studio for reviews. Ada asked whether the harbour room is free in the afternoon. The lift near the loading bay is slow today. The garden studio is being repainted, so expect some noise in the evening. For catering at the Brenwick summit, we'll go with buffet. The coffee machine in the north office is working again. Vik and Teo are swapping desks this week. Una asked whether the harbour room is free in the afternoon."
}
